        "subtitle": "arXiv",
        "date": "September 16, 2024",
        "description": "We open source a PyTorch implementation of the Spectral Transform Unit (STU) as proposed in Agarwal et al. (2024). We investigate sequence prediction tasks over several modalities including language, robotics, and simulated dynamical systems. We find that for the same parameter count, the STU and its variants outperform the leading state-of-the-art models, such as the Transformer and other leading state space models across various modalities."
